  m_Name: 0 StartGame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GamePlay::GamePlay.Level.ConversationData
  ID: 0
  TriggerType: 0
  Conversations:
  - Welcome to Project Festival!
  - This game is inspired by real-world winter light festivals.
  - "Due to the current lack of suitable assets, the visual resemblance to the real
    festival is\u2026 let\u2019s say, still a work in progress (lol). "
  - 'Your goal is simple:'
  - "Make this festival famous, ensure every visitor leaves with a smile \u2014 and
    of course, earn a bit of money along the way."
  - "At the top of the screen, you\u2019ll see your core resources:"
  - 'On the left is your funds, and on the right is satisfaction. '
  - "When you fulfill visitors\u2019 needs, satisfaction will steadily increase."
  - "Once it reaches certain thresholds, you\u2019ll unlock new and more powerful
    buildings to construct."
  - 'Funds are used to build facilities, but keep this in mind:'
  - "Not every building generates profit directly. Many of them require ongoing maintenance
    costs \u2014 though they will greatly boost visitor happiness."
  - Experiment boldly with your management strategies.
  - "But always keep an eye on your balance \u2014 bankruptcy is a real possibility."
  - "That said, the game isn\u2019t completely ruthless: the first time you go bankrupt,
    we\u2019ll provide you with one last bailout to help you get back on your feet."
  Effects: []
